  "title": "Taqueria-Style Tacos - Carne Asada",
  "description": "Tender carne asada tacos with flavorsome strips of marinated steak in soft tortillas with homemade spicy salsa and cotija cheese - just like you'd get at a taqueria!",
  "authors": [
    "stanicks"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-23T17:50:33-04:00",
